  "description": "The Innokin Endura T20S is a straightforward vape kit that makes your vaping journey effortlessly smooth and endlessly enjoyable. Featuring a 1500mAh built-in battery and a consistent 18W output, this kit is your dependable ally for a full day of vaping. No complex settings or fiddly menus to deal with; a simple press of the fire button activates your device, letting you inhale pure flavour through the mouthpiece. At the heart of this kit is the Prism T20S Tank, a MTL vaper's dream. With a 2ml e-liquid capacity, the tank delivers a rich flavour profile and a satisfying throat hit. Top-filling has never been easier or cleaner thanks to the tank’s leakproof design; just unscrew the top cap and pour in your e-liquid, and you're good to go. The 0.8ohm Prism-S Coils are optimized to give you the ideal airflow and draw, while the organic cotton wicking ensures even deeper, more intense flavour. All these features come together to offer you a vape that's both simple and satisfying. In terms of maintenance, the Prism T20S Tank comes apart easily for convenient cleaning. Its 510-threaded design also makes it a versatile choice for pairing with other devices. So, if you’re searching for a vape kit that offers a balance of convenience, performance, and flavour, look no further than the Innokin Endura T20S. Perfectly suited for high-PG e-liquids, this kit has everything you need for a tailored vaping experience. Please Note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Coils, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming’ simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
